  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong> Bynumide is a purpose-driven brand committed to empowering women, especially those in rural areas, by providing a platform to showcase and sell their handmade products. We aim to promote sustainable living, support local artisans, and foster a community that values craftsmanship and ethical commerce.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong> Our product line features handmade items, including fashion accessories, home decor, and unique artisanal crafts. Each product is carefully crafted with high-quality materials and reflects the cultural heritage and personal stories of the women who create them.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong> Bynumide&rsquo;s unique selling point is its dedication to empowering women through economic opportunity. Our products are not only beautifully crafted but also contribute to a larger mission of social good, as a portion of profits goes towards supporting women's entrepreneurship and skill development.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong> We offer flexible payment options, including major credit cards, PayPal, and online bank transfers. For bulk orders, customized payment plans can be arranged to accommodate specific business needs.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong> At Bynumide, we believe in sustainability and ethical practices. All our products are made from environmentally friendly materials, and we prioritize fair wages for our artisans. Additionally, we provide global shipping with eco-conscious packaging.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n</div>",
